  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How To Embrace A Swamp Creature**: rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n- **Your Belgian Things**: back after 86 archived shows (2212 days) [6]\n- **Pure Heat**: back after 111 archived shows (3226 days); rare: 6 archived performances [6]\n- **Going To Bristol**: back after 106 archived shows (3056 days); rare: 7 archived performances [6]\n- **Alpha Omega**: back after 69 archived shows (1774 days) [6]\n- **Stench Of The Unburied**: rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2018-04-14.bootleg** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 97 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio quality captured the mood of the show effectively; Reviewer calls this specific performance their favorite version of the song; Listener describes the recording quality as incredible [2][3][5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Listener hears their own voice and new friends in the recording [4]\n- Listener praises Matt Douglas, calling him a god amongst men [4]\n- Reviewer mentions a girl who got mad at them for swaying [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2018-04-14.bootleg**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes [1]. Also: Uploader provides a tracklist mapping songs to their original albums [1]",
